stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> New
    New --> AcceptedUnmarked: EmptyMailbox or BusyActiveTurn / eligible owned front
    New --> AcceptedQueued: gate closed, Herdr, Codex, bot or follower / mailbox
    AcceptedUnmarked --> AcceptedUnmarked: restart preserves durable queue and receipt
    AcceptedUnmarked --> Plus: submitted
    AcceptedUnmarked --> Mailbox: HandedBack or pre-injection NotSent fallback
    AcceptedUnmarked --> Question: Unconfirmed
    AcceptedQueued --> Mailbox: adapter / V2 source still queued
    AcceptedQueued --> Invisible: before / empty V1 list hides queued V2 source
    Mailbox --> HeldFront: permission modal keeps A held
    HeldFront --> HeldWithFollower: non-merging B / mailbox B
    HeldWithFollower --> HeldWithFollower: retry A / keep A and B pending
